# Untracked working files, which the handoff and doc-review commands write to the repository root.
# They are scratch rather than documentation, and a local `markdownlint --fix` run would otherwise
# rewrite them.
#
# The leading slash anchors each pattern to the repository root. Without it these would also match
# the tracked home/.claude/commands/handoff.md and doc-review.md, since the matching is
# case-insensitive.
/*DOC-REVIEW.md
/*HANDOFF.md
/*PLAN.md
/local-review*.md
